# Keep this directory in git, but none of its contents.
#
# The Go binary embeds web/dist, and embedding a directory that does not exist
# is a compile error, so `go build ./...` in a fresh clone would fail before the
# frontend had ever been built. With this file the build succeeds and the panel
# reports that it has no user interface, which is a much better failure.
#
# Run `npm --prefix web run build` to fill it.
*
!.gitignore
